cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite this repository and record the exact Git revision you ran."
title: "CompBias: Auditable Compensability-Bias Experiments"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "CompBias contributors"
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  An auditable implementation of exact, tabular, small-neural, controlled
  visual-world experiments and safety-gated VLM experiment plans for studying
  compensability bias and spurious compensation equilibria under outcome-only
  reinforcement learning.
keywords:
  - multimodal reinforcement learning
  - compensability bias
  - error coupling
  - reproducibility
